,"sumOfMeToo":32,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":25.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1508853618610479104,"date":1648573710000,"rawContent":"It\u2019s very easy to allow the cries \nof your past become \nthe screams of your future. \nLet your truth become earmuffs and your voice \nbe your megaphone\n#SpeakUp #MentalHealthMatters #metoo #PTSD","userId":1490004567974719490,"media":null,"username":"Abusesurvivors5","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":25.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":33,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":25.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1509332771122167816,"date":1648687949000,"rawContent":"@ggbrokensilence #metoo these women are strong survivors. We stand with Ukraine, and hear the women. War doesn\u2019t make rapists. It just creates the playground for those who already were.","userId":1490004567974719490,"media":null,"username":"Abusesurvivors5","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":25.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":34,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":25.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1509945550615027721,"date":1648834047000,"rawContent":"Survivors tend to lead with anger because that\u2019s all we were given but if those same survivors are met with love\u2026\nWell it\u2019s gonna take a long time before we trust \nBut leading with love is a start. Don\u2019t give up, survivors do come around. \n#survive #metoo #semicolon #PTSD #love","userId":1490004567974719490,"media":null,"username":"Abusesurvivors5","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":fal