grief #growthmindset","userId":1490004567974719490,"media":null,"username":"Abusesurvivors5","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":44,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1529083693364543490,"date":1653396936000,"rawContent":"Having hobbies to keep the demons at bay is very useful! \n\nWe\u2019re a two person team on this account \n\nOne of us gardens and the other is obsessed with hiking! \n\nWhat are your positive hobbies? \n\n#Hobbies #gardening #Hike #MentalHealthMatters #MentalHealthAwareness #MeToo","userId":1490004567974719490,"media":null,"username":"Abusesurvivors5","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":45,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1533273469428842496,"date":1654395856000,"rawContent":"We\u2019re tired. \n\n#GunControlNow #MeToo #RoeVWade \n\nWe\u2019re tired.","userId":1490004567974719490,"media":null,"username":"Abusesurvivors5","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":46,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1535047762537984000,"date":1654818881000,"rawContent":"Abusers need you to be broken. They will work until you break. \n\nRemember, you can rebuild. \nThey\u2019ll just find someone new.\n\n#Survive #MeToo #StayAlive #StayStrong","userId":1490004567